      'Opening deal: 4-4 player(s), 7 card(s) per player, 1 deck(s), initial visibility face_down.',
      'Opening flow: start in deal; dealer may use deal_7_stock_4 before bidding.',
      'Scoring check: Declarer wins or loses game points (1 game point ≈ 10 card points). Achieved: card points in tricks plus stock, rounded; +5 last trick; +10 bonus for all seven tricks. Required: bid + 10 minus (meld points ÷ 10). Win difference or lose 2×difference + 10; no stock doubles amount. Expected outcome: Declarer must take at least the bid number of card points (tricks + stock + melds). Game points: achieved minus required; loss = 2×shortfall + 10..',
